# Transcribed from Movy's browser-test/logic/automation.mjs at 9190e79
# (github.com/DimaDake/schwung-movy, MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 megadake;
# engines/third_party/movy/LICENSE) to the FM-1's panel (docs/15 S8).
# Its "automation registry" and "knob routing": the first turn of a
# parameter on a held step's lock page gives it a lane (`alabel 0 0
# synth:Timbre`, and `abase 0 0 64`: Timbre at 0.5 is 64, as Movy's cutoff
# at 1 of 0..2), then writes a quiet lock at the held step (`aset 0 0 4 N
# 1`); a second turn moves it on. Its "hold+knob gesture": the step's
# release then toggles nothing. Macro, from steps.verbs.
--button 0.05:SEQ
--key 0.10:7:100:0.6
--turn 0.20:SELECT:1
--turn 0.25:SELECT:1
--turn 0.30:KNOB3:1
--turn 0.40:KNOB3:2
--button 0.90:PLAY/STOP
